	<meta property="og:description" content="What is Buddhism Good Question, Good Answer with Ven. S. Dhammika Question: What is Buddhism? Answer: The name Buddhism comes from the word &#8216;budhi&#8217; which means &#8216;to wake up&#8217; and thus Buddhism is the philosophy of awakening. This philosophy has its origins in the experience of the man Siddhata Gotama, known as the Buddha, who [&hellip;]" />
